# UniFi CEF syslog samples for test.py.
#
# Each log line is preceded by an "# expect:" line:
#   decoder=NAME     decoder that must match ("!NAME" = must NOT be NAME, "none" = no decoder)
#   rule=ID level=N  rule that must fire (needs ../wazuh-unifi-rules mounted in the lab)
#   fields=a,b       decoded fields that must be present and non-empty
# "live" samples are real controller output with hostnames, client names, MACs and IPs
# anonymized. "synthetic" samples are hand-written for events not yet seen live.

